<title>USA: DVI Inc issues $100 mln debt due 2004.</title>
<headline>DVI Inc issues $100 mln debt due 2004.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from DVI Inc, a medical equipment leasing company, was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Prudential Securities Inc.</p>
<p>The notes were issued at the tight side of price talk, which went as wide as 10.135 percent, market sources said.</p>
<p>BORROWER DVI INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 9.875 PCT  MATURITY 2/01/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.38   FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 10.00 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B			  CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
